<!-- ═══════════════ SECTION 1: OVERVIEW ═══════════════ -->
<section id="overview">
  <h2>1. Dataset Overview &amp; Coverage Summary</h2>

  <p>This report analyses UK retail fuel price data collected under the government's open data mandate for forecourt fuel pricing. The dataset was sourced from <strong>fuelcosts.co.uk</strong>, which aggregates price data from over 8,000 petrol stations across England, Scotland, and Wales via the official Fuel Finder API.</p>

